      "text": "Meet you down the shops: Powerhouse Parramatta’s The Mall exhibition – in pictures"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Launching as part of the new Powerhouse Museum Parramatta , the two-storey art and design exhibition The Mall examines the history, evolution and cultural significance of the shopping mall. The ‘My Mall’ series of 100 new photographic works by Jo Duck and Bahram Mia , commissioned by the Powerhouse for the exhibition, documents the intersection of private retail and public space in the malls and shopping strips of western Sydney",
